module main:
- t1: mutex_lock main::a; mutex_lock main::b; mutex_unlock main::b; mutex_unlock main::a
- t2: mutex_lock main::a; mutex_lock main::b; mutex_unlock main::b; mutex_unlock main::a
- main: start [main::t1, main::t2]

